<font color="#FF9966">♫  Yes, the promise land  ♫</font>

482
00:41:30.291 --> 00:41:31.875
<font color="#FF9966">♫  Oh gosh now  ♫</font>

483
00:41:31.958 --> 00:41:33.625
<font color="#FF9966">♫  To the promise land  ♫</font>

484
00:41:36.166 --> 00:41:39.541
