485
00:41:39.625 --> 00:41:43.000
<font color="#FF9966">♫  Then we stopped in Addis Ababa  ♫</font>

486
00:41:43.583 --> 00:41:46.625
<font color="#FF9966">♫  Made our way to Shashamane land  ♫</font>

487
